    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tasks on the ToDo LisT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to break free from repetitive and tedious routines, and find a way out through completing daily tasks.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357930/extras/5be9e4168a43b552149771ceb6c848bf.poster.avif?t=1755336325\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357930/extras/5be9e4168a43b552149771ceb6c848bf.webm?t=1755336325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357930/extras/5be9e4168a43b552149771ceb6c848bf.mp4?t=1755336325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In daily tasks, your choices may lead to different endings; don't just focus on completing them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357930/extras/ba02f683435efef49789590aeb099888.poster.avif?t=1755336325\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357930/extras/ba02f683435efef49789590aeb099888.webm?t=1755336325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357930/extras/ba02f683435efef49789590aeb099888.mp4?t=1755336325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special Puzzle Solving Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though surrounded by black, white, and gray, other colors will always break into life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357930/extras/4b7f09f9bef18498fc382a4adea3a058.poster.avif?t=1755336325\" width=800 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357930/extras/4b7f09f9bef18498fc382a4adea3a058.webm?t=1755336325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357930/extras/4b7f09f9bef18498fc382a4adea3a058.mp4?t=1755336325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357930/extras/ce4ef99d9fc7001aaf2e43b969d7f5ba.avif?t=1755336325\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tasks on the ToDo LisT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to break free from repetitive and tedious routines, and find a way out through completing daily tasks.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357930/extras/5be9e4168a43b552149771ceb6c848bf.poster.avif?t=1755336325\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357930/extras/5be9e4168a43b552149771ceb6c848bf.webm?t=1755336325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357930/extras/5be9e4168a43b552149771ceb6c848bf.mp4?t=1755336325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In daily tasks, your choices may lead to different endings; don't just focus on completing them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357930/extras/ba02f683435efef49789590aeb099888.poster.avif?t=1755336325\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357930/extras/ba02f683435efef49789590aeb099888.webm?t=1755336325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357930/extras/ba02f683435efef49789590aeb099888.mp4?t=1755336325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Special Puzzle Solving Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though surrounded by black, white, and gray, other colors will always break into life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357930/extras/4b7f09f9bef18498fc382a4adea3a058.poster.avif?t=1755336325\" width=800 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357930/extras/4b7f09f9bef18498fc382a4adea3a058.webm?t=1755336325\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357930/extras/4b7f09f9bef18498fc382a4adea3a058.mp4?t=1755336325\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357930/extras/ce4ef99d9fc7001aaf2e43b969d7f5ba.avif?t=1755336325\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p>",
